#~ "Defend the forests of the elves against the first orcs to reach the Great "
#~ "Continent, learning valuable tactics as you do so.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Försvara alvernas skogar mot de första orcherna som nådde den stora "
